-- title:
--   Straight-line segments of the BSP construction block: core box, sides, split and copy
-- statement:
--   Twenty-one straight-line facts about the program $\mathrm{bd}$ of definition `DetANN_HPIMBuildProg`: the core box, the longest sides, the split and the copy-and-set subroutine.
--
--   Every conjunct has the same shape. Let $Q$ contain $\mathrm{bd}(o)$ at offset $o$ (`Embeds Q (bd off) off`), and let $s$ be a non-halted state at the stated pc with $1\le$ pointer 1 and the stated hypotheses. Then after exactly the stated number $t$ of steps, the run of $Q$ from $s$:
--   - is at the stated pc (relative to $o$) and has not halted;
--   - has the stated values in the changed registers and cells;
--   - leaves all other pointer and real registers and all other real and integer cells unchanged;
--   - has work $s.\mathrm{work}+t$, and its `cellsWritten` set consists of the listed cells.
--
--   Pointer 1 holds $m$, pointer 11 holds $n$, and $Z$, $R$ denote pointers 13, 14 of $s$.
--
--   1. **Core exit** $134\to161$ (1): when $j\ge m$.
--   2. **Core step** $134\to134$ (27): coordinate $j$ of $q$ becomes $[\max(q_j-2r,lo_j),\min(q_{m+j}+2r,hi_j)]$, where $[lo,hi]$ is the task box at pointer 43.
--   3. **Sides start** $161\to172$ (11): reals 51, 52 := the side 0 of $q$ and of the task box; $j:=1$.
--   4. **Sides exit** $172\to197$ (1).
--   5. **Sides step** $172\to172$ (25): reals 51, 52 take the maximum with side $j$.
--   6. **Carve** $197\to280$ (3): when $2\sigma_{51}-\sigma_{52}\le0$.
--   7. **Split** $197\to201$ (4): otherwise; axis $53:=0$.
--   8. **Axis, next** $201\to201$ (9): when side $k<\sigma_{52}$: $k:=k+1$.
--   9. **Axis, found** $201\to210$ (7): when $\sigma_{52}\le$ side $k$: reals $44,45:=lo_k,hi_k$.
--   10. **Split node** $210\to258$ (16): real $44:=(lo_k+hi_k)/2$; a cut node $[1,p]$ at $Z-4$ with $I[\text{slot}]:=Z-4$; copy-and-set of the task box with index $m+k$ and code 0.
--   11. **Left push** $226\to258$ (17): pushes $[\text{new box},\text{node}+2,\text{link}]$; copy-and-set of the task box with index $k$ and code 1.
--   12. **Right push** $243\to34$ (15): pushes $[\text{new box},\text{node}+3,\text{link}]$.
--   13. **Copy head** $258\to261$ (3): pointers $14,56:=R-2m$, $46:=0$.
--   14. **Copy step** $261\to261$ (7): when $i<2m$, real cell $p_{56}+i$ gets the value of $p_{50}+i$.
--   15. **Copy exit** $261\to268$ (1).
--   16–21. **Set and return, codes 0–5** $268\to226,243,304,321,348,366$ (3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 12 steps): real cell $p_{56}+p_{51}$ gets real 44, then the return by the code in pointer 58.
-- source:
